## Tableau Story Structure
| Dashboard | Description |
|------------|-------------|
| **1. Market Overview** | Benchmark 2025 EV performance (range, efficiency, charging). |
| **2. Range vs Efficiency** | Identify high-value models and trade-offs. |
| **3. Performance Drivers** | Correlation between battery capacity and range; charging speed analysis. |
| **4. Segment-Level Trade-offs** | Compare SUVs, Sedans, and Hatchbacks. |
| **5. Manufacturer Portfolio** | Brand competitiveness by range, efficiency, and charging. |
| **6. Summary & Recommendations** | Key takeaways and strategic insights. |

---

## Recommendations

| Stakeholder | Action |
|--------------|---------|
| **Manufacturers** | Invest in ultra-fast charging R&D and SUV efficiency improvement. |
| **Policymakers** | Incentivize balanced EV segments (Sedans, Liftbacks). |
| **Investors** | Focus on brands leading in charging and efficiency innovation. |

